                using.  The pin the red wire feeds is VIN; the board accepts
                either 3.3 or 5 V logic, and in this course we use 3.3 V.</caption>
                <image source="images/Day13-I2C(3)/stemma_wiring.svg" width="92%"/>
            </figure>

            <slide xml:id="sl-day13-wiring" ref="fig-accel-wiring">
    <caption>Black to GND, red to 3.3 V, yellow to SCL (D15, PB8), blue to SDA (D14, PB9), and the display stays wired.</caption>
